10\">10kg<\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><h3>Application Industry<\/h3><ul><li><strong>Oil and Gas Industry<\/strong><\/li><\/ul><p>During the extraction and processing of oil and natural gas, stainless steel filter bags are used to remove solid impurities from liquids to ensure product purity and normal operation of equipment. Such as filtering downhole operating fluid, mud, drilling fluid, etc.<\/p><ul><li><strong>Chemical Industry<\/strong><\/li><\/ul><p>Used to filter acids, alkalis, solvents and other chemicals in chemical production to ensure product quality and production safety. Such as impurity filtration and catalyst recovery in reactors and separation equipment.<\/p><ul><li><strong>Food and Beverage Industry<\/strong><\/li><\/ul><p>In beverage production, beer brewing, dairy processing, etc., it is used to filter particles, microorganisms, etc. in liquids to ensure food safety and quality. Ensure products meet hygiene standards and extend product shelf life.<\/p><ul><li><strong>Pharmaceutical Industry<\/strong><\/li><\/ul><p>In pharmaceutical production, it is used to filter medicinal liquids, injections, etc. to ensure the purity and safety of medicines.<br \/>Suitable for high-demand sterile environments to prevent cross-contamination.<\/p><ul><li><strong>Water Treatment<\/strong><\/li><\/ul><p>Used for industrial wastewater treatment and domestic water purification to remove suspended solids, particles, bacteria, etc. in the water. Such as used in seawater desalination and pure water production.<\/p><ul><li><strong>Electronics and Semiconductor Industry<\/strong><\/li><\/ul><p>In the production process of electronic components, it is used for the preparation of high-purity water and the filtration of various chemicals.<br \/>Ensure the high purity of products and the cleanliness of the production environment.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-85e9c31 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\